1
00:00:39,764 --> 00:00:45,696
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,035 --> 00:00:48,672
=Episode 16=

3
00:00:57,119 --> 00:00:57,799
Got you!

4
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:01,960
Lizhi.

5
00:01:03,159 --> 00:01:03,920
It's you, isn't it?

6
00:01:04,719 --> 00:01:05,239
No, wait.

7
00:01:06,079 --> 00:01:07,560
How could you be Lizhi?

8
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:09,680
How could the mighty Loong Lord

9
00:01:10,519 --> 00:01:11,599
turn

10
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,640
into a bird

11
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,719
and secretly follow me?

12
00:01:15,719 --> 00:01:16,719
Besides,

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,079
you're ugly.

14
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,599
Dingy yellow,

15
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,120
wearing blush.

16
00:01:23,079 --> 00:01:24,239
You're not pretty at all.

17
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,120
If Loong Lord were to transform,

18
00:01:27,799 --> 00:01:29,040
he'd surely be a phoenix,

19
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:30,040
a peacock,

20
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,400
or a crane.

21
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,359
But he'd never be an ugly bird like you.

22
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:34,480
Ugly bird?

23
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:35,760
Is it ugly?

24
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,248
Silly bird,

25
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:38,176
huh?

26
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:43,799
Besides,

27
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:45,519
you're so tiny

28
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:47,079
that I can hold you with one hand.

29
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:50,840
He can't be this weak.

30
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:55,879
Pretty spunky.

31
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:57,840
Let me check your gender.

32
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,280
If you're female,

33
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,159
I'll let you go.

34
00:02:00,319 --> 00:02:02,519
If you're male,
I'll roast you and eat you up.

35
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,879
Glaring at me?

36
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,520
You're just a bird.

37
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,639
What can you do to me?

38
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,639
Stop hiding from me.

39
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,800
Just show yourself.

40
00:02:18,319 --> 00:02:20,080
Why won't you show up again?

41
00:02:39,199 --> 00:02:39,719
Xingyao!

42
00:03:05,199 --> 00:03:05,919
Xingyao!

43
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,240
Xingyao!

44
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:16,800
My men

45
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:18,680
have improved their martial arts a lot.

46
00:03:21,319 --> 00:03:22,240
(You really are here.)

47
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,159
(Since you're protecting me,)

48
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:25,319
(why won't you show up?)

49
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,039
(He stayed)

50
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:28,919
(to protect me.)

51
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,280
(He's hiding)

52
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,280
(because...)

53
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:38,800
I'll keep helping you

54
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,280
until

55
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,479
you safely return home.

56
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,000
You want me to leave?

57
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,120
Turns out

58
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:51,520
he wasn't mad
about the misunderstanding.

59
00:03:52,479 --> 00:03:53,240
It's because

60
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,680
I wanted him to leave.

61
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:57,599
Xingyao,

62
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:58,759
I'll check outside.

63
00:03:59,080 --> 00:03:59,719
You stay here.

64
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,520
Dangerous outside!

65
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,199
You can't go out either!

66
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,520
Don't worry.

67
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:06,639
I'll send men to protect her.

68
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,000
The river is freezing.

69
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:55,600
Want to die?

70
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:57,639
I...

71
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,600
I missed you.

72
00:05:28,084 --> 00:05:32,704
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

73
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,240
May I?

74
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:39,480
At such a time, you don't need to ask.

75
00:05:41,248 --> 00:05:45,984
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

76
00:05:46,400 --> 00:05:49,664
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

77
00:05:49,664 --> 00:05:51,424
♪Refusing to forget♪

78
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:56,480
So,

79
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,839
when do I not need to ask?

80
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,720
From now on,

81
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,439
when I say it's snowing,

82
00:06:06,759 --> 00:06:07,519
that means you may.

83
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:10,839
It's snowing.

84
00:06:13,248 --> 00:06:15,904
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

85
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:17,600
It's snowing.

86
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:36,600
Lizhi, can you stop using your power

87
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,000
to hurt people?

88
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,279
Still afraid of me?

89
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:45,079
Sometimes I'm afraid of you,

90
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,720
but that's normal.

91
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,439
Even between ordinary people,

92
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,480
nobody is totally satisfied
with each other.

93
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,959
Even Xingyao and I

94
00:06:54,439 --> 00:06:55,759
sometimes bicker.

95
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:59,120
Even if you leave tomorrow,

96
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,240
today,

97
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,000
I still want to stay with you.

98
00:07:04,879 --> 00:07:06,279
What I'm saying has nothing

99
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,319
to do with any deal.

100
00:07:10,319 --> 00:07:11,800
It's just how I truly feel.

101
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,560
I'm not afraid of you hurting them.

102
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,519
They had it coming

103
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,560
and deserve no pity.

104
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,800
I only care about you.

105
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:25,759
Lizhi.

106
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:28,199
I'm afraid.

107
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,240
I'm afraid your power will

108
00:07:31,279 --> 00:07:32,319
make you lose control.

109
00:07:33,519 --> 00:07:35,519
I'm afraid your Li Fire will backfire

110
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:37,720
on yourself.

111
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:42,439
I'm afraid

112
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:45,399
you'll get hurt.

113
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:47,959
So,

114
00:07:49,079 --> 00:07:51,079
I'll be extra careful from now on.

115
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,800
Can you promise me

116
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:57,279
never to let yourself get hurt again?

117
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:05,888
All right.

118
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:18,439
I promise you.

119
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,040
I won't hurt folks.

120
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,279
However...

121
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:24,920
Useless fools!

122
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,399
A bunch of trash!

123
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,079
Mother, didn't you say

124
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,199
they were top assassins?

125
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:33,440
They failed to kill Yue Wangshu
when she was alone.

126
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,360
Madam, My Lady,

127
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,759
Master Qiyang still hasn't woken up.

128
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,720
I knew it.

129
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,519
She is with a sorcerer.

130
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:50,360
That's why she's so hard to hurt.

131
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,559
I'll see

132
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:57,720
if you have what it takes

133
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,559
to hide for the rest of your life.

134
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:22,639
Qiyang!

135
00:09:22,639 --> 00:09:23,296
Yang!

136
00:09:24,759 --> 00:09:25,279
Yang!

137
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,600
It's him.

138
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,759
He's back!

139
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:29,200
Loong Lord!

140
00:09:30,759 --> 00:09:31,960
There is no Loong Lord!

141
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,240
What are you talking about?

142
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,879
Don't scare me!

143
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,879
Yue Wangshu is behind this!

144
00:09:37,159 --> 00:09:38,559
What kind of sorcery is this?

145
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,679
I'll send men to...

146
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,600
Yang!

147
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,159
Mother!

148
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,000
Mother!

149
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,039
Please, stop talking!

150
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,279
Stop it!

151
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:49,960
Apologize!

152
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,200
Apologize!

153
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,399
Apologize to the Loong Lord right now!

154
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,240
Promise we won't

155
00:09:55,799 --> 00:09:57,039
harm Yue Wangshu again!

156
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,960
I don't want to die!

157
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,600
I don't...

158
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,279
I'm done with all this burning!

159
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:02,879
Loong Lord!

160
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:04,559
Loong Lord!

161
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:08,039
Loong Lord, spare my son, please!

162
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:10,399
Loong Lord, spare my son, please!

163
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,559
It was my fault.

164
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:14,080
I made a stupid mistake.

165
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:16,039
I will never dare to do it again!

166
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,360
Never again!

167
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,440
Yue Wangshu...

168
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,200
No, Loong Consort!

169
00:10:20,519 --> 00:10:21,639
I will never dare

170
00:10:21,639 --> 00:10:24,840
show the slightest disrespect
to Loong Consort!

171
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,120
Please spare us, Loong Lord!

172
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:28,360
Have mercy, Loong Lord!

173
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:31,919
Please spare my son's life!

174
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,200
What about you?

175
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,840
I was wrong!

176
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,840
I'll never do it again!

177
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,840
Yang!

178
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:47,919
Yang!

179
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:49,519
Yang!

180
00:10:52,159 --> 00:10:53,480
What kind of sorcery is this?

181
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,039
Could loongs really exist?

182
00:10:58,039 --> 00:10:59,320
Ready a carriage!

183
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,879
I'll go to the capital to see Prince Qi!

184
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,279
Madam, His Highness ordered

185
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:05,919
that anyone here can't make a move

186
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:06,679
and awaits orders.

187
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,919
Lizhi, where did you go?

188
00:11:35,347 --> 00:11:37,216
♪If the wind were a verb♪

189
00:11:37,632 --> 00:11:40,160
♪Blowing through my thoughts♪

190
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:41,679
From now on,

191
00:11:42,159 --> 00:11:43,559
never leave me alone again.

192
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:46,048
♪Spreading throughout my heart♪

193
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,720
All right.

194
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,120
I promise you.

195
00:11:52,128 --> 00:11:56,832
♪I seek in the moonlight
for the rest of my life♪

196
00:11:57,760 --> 00:12:00,032
♪If love were a noun♪

197
00:12:00,064 --> 00:12:02,880
♪Woven with pain♪

198
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:08,448
♪I softly murmur your name
between heartbeats♪

199
00:12:08,992 --> 00:12:14,048
♪As ripples stir
in the corner of our eyes♪

200
00:12:14,592 --> 00:12:20,800
♪Wherever our gazes meet,
passion settles♪

201
00:12:22,995 --> 00:12:25,888
♪Letting the longing in your eyes♪

202
00:12:25,888 --> 00:12:28,704
♪Take root after drowning♪

203
00:12:28,704 --> 00:12:34,112
♪Like a silent, unfeeling,
restrained kiss♪

204
00:12:34,208 --> 00:12:39,808
♪Step by step, inch by inch,
tracing your silhouette♪

205
00:12:39,904 --> 00:12:45,408
♪A rouge-tinted letter
brings a distant lover close♪

206
00:12:45,408 --> 00:12:50,912
♪Torn apart by time,
regrets still intertwine♪

207
00:12:51,264 --> 00:12:56,544
♪We hope to meet, but won't confess♪

208
00:12:56,768 --> 00:13:02,176
♪You're the one I wish to hold
through every page and scene♪

209
00:13:03,919 --> 00:13:05,559
Was there a storm last night?

210
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:06,759
Why?

211
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:09,200
My boat was good yesterday
when rented to the Zhangs.

212
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:09,879
Take a look.

213
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,200
Looks like the Loong Lord

214
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:13,360
flipped it upside down.

215
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:21,799
Get out of here.

216
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,799
Good heavens!

217
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,000
She can barely walk.

218
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,679
That man really knows
how to dote on her.

219
00:13:39,519 --> 00:13:40,480
Lizhi,

220
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:42,559
put me down!

221
00:13:42,919 --> 00:13:43,519
Put me down!

222
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:44,320
I can walk myself.

223
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,320
Is that the Yue Pharmacy?

224
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,240
It's crowded there.

225
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:47,720
They're stirring up things.

226
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:48,720
Let's go and see.

227
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:49,696
Okay, let's go.

228
00:13:52,256 --> 00:13:53,024
What's going on?

229
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:54,960
(Yue Pharmacy)
Give our money back!

230
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:56,519
- Pay us back!
- Pay us back!

231
00:13:56,519 --> 00:14:00,879
- Give our money back!
- Give our money back!

232
00:14:00,879 --> 00:14:03,039
- Give our money back!
- Give our money back!

233
00:14:03,559 --> 00:14:05,600
- Quiet down!
- Pay us back!

234
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:07,960
If you new owners deny old debts,

235
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:09,519
do you expect us workers

236
00:14:09,759 --> 00:14:10,720
to starve?

237
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,120
Debts get paid, no exceptions!

238
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,519
You must pay us back today!

239
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:18,039
- Pay us back!
- Pay us back!

240
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:21,159
Everyone, please calm down!

241
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,440
What is going on here?

242
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:31,159
Master Wei Xun,

243
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,000
a few days ago,

244
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:35,559
these people were all grateful
to the two young ladies.

245
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:38,639
Who knows
what rumors they heard recently?

246
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:42,080
Early this morning, they showed up,

247
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,080
claiming the General's Manor
borrowed money from them.

248
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:47,159
Since the two ladies
took over the business,

249
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:49,399
they demand the ladies pay them.

250
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,600
These are all old ledgers.

251
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:53,639
The ledgers are a mess,

252
00:14:54,120 --> 00:14:55,639
and there's no way to verify them now.

253
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:57,799
I suspect

254
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,000
someone planned this on purpose.

255
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:01,480
I bet someone instigated this.

256
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:05,159
Knowing the sisters are under my wing,

257
00:15:05,559 --> 00:15:06,600
how dare they mess around!

258
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:07,399
Wait.

259
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,039
Master Wei, stay out of this.

260
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,759
If you get involved

261
00:15:12,759 --> 00:15:13,799
and draw criticism,

262
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:14,840
it won't help your work.

263
00:15:17,639 --> 00:15:18,440
Everyone!

264
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:20,879
When the first branch ran things,

265
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:23,679
they scammed people
using my father's name,

266
00:15:23,960 --> 00:15:25,679
leaving behind a pile of bad debts.

267
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:26,600
Now that

268
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,679
my sister and I have taken over,

269
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:31,759
all accounts will be thoroughly audited.

270
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,000
If a debt is legitimate,

271
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,200
I promise

272
00:15:34,440 --> 00:15:35,879
we'll pay you back with interest.

273
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:39,320
But if anyone tries to take advantage

274
00:15:39,639 --> 00:15:41,200
by forging deeds to cause trouble...

275
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,240
You may have already heard

276
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:47,360
about how we handle lawsuits.

277
00:15:47,799 --> 00:15:48,679
Right now,

278
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:50,480
the real creditors

279
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,320
go to register with Uncle Fu.

280
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,679
If you leave here sooner

281
00:15:53,799 --> 00:15:55,080
and wait for verification,

282
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:56,679
your interest will double.

283
00:15:57,360 --> 00:15:58,159
However,

284
00:15:58,799 --> 00:16:00,200
the last ten people to leave

285
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:01,679
will get no money at all

286
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:03,639
and prove their deeds are real.

287
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,559
If you can't,

288
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:05,679
you'll go to yamen.

289
00:16:06,039 --> 00:16:07,120
Fine, I'll register!

290
00:16:09,879 --> 00:16:10,399
Guys,

291
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,559
don't you see?

292
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,159
This is just a delaying tactic!

293
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,600
They're even threatening us!

294
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:17,279
Let's help ourselves!

295
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:19,000
Look!

296
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:20,080
Inside this shop,

297
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,919
there's plenty of valuable goods!

298
00:16:21,919 --> 00:16:23,120
Let's clean it out

299
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,200
to settle the debt!

300
00:16:24,279 --> 00:16:26,000
We should take back

301
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,679
what's rightfully ours!

302
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:28,919
- Right?
- Right!

303
00:16:28,919 --> 00:16:30,000
Rush in!

304
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,159
(Yue Pharmacy)
Empty the shop!

305
00:16:31,519 --> 00:16:32,200
Take our stuff!

306
00:16:33,299 --> 00:16:34,016
Charge in!

307
00:16:42,450 --> 00:16:47,025
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

308
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:52,297
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

309
00:16:55,536 --> 00:17:00,658
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

310
00:17:00,658 --> 00:17:03,997
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

311
00:17:03,997 --> 00:17:05,361
♪Refusing to forget♪

312
00:17:09,027 --> 00:17:13,804
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

313
00:17:14,355 --> 00:17:16,145
♪He cannot learn them♪

314
00:17:16,145 --> 00:17:19,280
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

315
00:17:22,432 --> 00:17:24,756
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

316
00:17:24,756 --> 00:17:27,119
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

317
00:17:27,697 --> 00:17:30,361
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

318
00:17:30,361 --> 00:17:32,119
♪Their days ahead are long♪
